ing="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span><span class="contents"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-4 md:w-5 xl:w-3.5 text-base font-heading font-bold leading-none select-none" style="color:#F0D060;text-shadow:0 0 6px #F0D06080" aria-hidden="true">➔</span><div class="relative w-11 h-11 md:w-12 md:h-12 xl:w-10 xl:h-10 flex-shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full flex items-center justify-center" style="background-color:rgba(240,208,96,0.08);border:1.5px solid rgba(240,208,96,0.40);box-shadow:0 0 12px #F0D06025, inset 0 0 0 1px #F0D06030"><img alt="Step 4" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_041619eeff63fa6b8ec5bee9c3af5591.png&amp;w=48&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 1x, https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_041619eeff63fa6b8ec5bee9c3af5591.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we 2x" src="https://wsrv.nl/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fakmweb.youngjoygame.com%2Fweb%2Fsvnres%2Fimg%2Ftest%2Fhomepage_2_2_16_1232_1%2F100_041619eeff63fa6b8ec5bee9c3af5591.png&amp;w=96&amp;output=webp&amp;q=75&amp;we"/></div></span></div><p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed md:flex-1">In teamfights, boost Attack Speed with their Ultimate
and control enemies with the enhanced 1st Skill for heavy damage. When enemies are close, use the enhanced 2nd Skill for protection.</p></div></div></section></div></div><div class="grid gap-4 md:gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2 items-start mb-4 md:mb-6"><div class="hero-overview relative lg:pl-4 lg:border-l lg:border-[#C8AA6E]/30"><span class="hidden lg:block absolute left-0 top-0 w-1 h-12 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#F0D060] via-[#C8AA6E] to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-[15px]">Popol and Kupa is a marksman for players who want to decide where the fight can happen before it starts. He wins by shrinking the map with traps, tagging the first target that steps wrong, and cashing that mistake into tower pressure. Pick him when your draft wants controlled corridors, not when you need a free-scaling backline gunner.</p></div><section class="dossier-card relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-border-default overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -22px rgba(0,0,0,0.85)" aria-label="Hero at-a-glance stats and attributes"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-mlbb-gold/0 via-mlbb-gold-bright/60 to-mlbb-gold/0" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold-bright/55" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative p-4 md:p-5"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 bg-mlbb-green/10 border border-mlbb-green/40" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-activity w-3 h-3 text-mlbb-green" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2"></path></svg></span><p class="text-[11px] font-heading font-bold text-text-accent uppercase tracking-[0.32em]">At a Glance</p></div><div class="grid gap-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-x-8 sm:gap-y-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Durability</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.45)"><div class="h-full relative" style="width:30%;background:linear-gradient(90deg, #3498DB80 0%, #3498DB 55%, #3498DB 100%);box-shadow:0 0 8px #3498DBaa, inset 0 0 8px #3498DB40"><div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image:linear-gradient(105deg, transparent 40%, rgba(255,255,255,0.22) 50%, transparent 60%);mix-blend-mode:overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:repeating-linear-gradient(to right, transparent 0, transparent calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) calc(10% - 1px), rgba(0,0,0,0.85) 10%)" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><span class="text-[12px] md:text-[13px] font-heading font-bold tabular-nums w-6 text-right leading-none" style="color:#3498DB;text-shadow:0 0 8px #3498DB50">30</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="text-[10px] md:text-[11px] text-text-muted font-heading uppercase tracking-[0.14em] w-[72px] md:w-20 flex-shrink-0 font-semibold">Offense</span><div class="relative flex-1 h-2.5 overflow-hidden" style="background:#060913;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(200,170,110,0.12), inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0