, #00AAFF, transparent)"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors font-heading uppercase tracking-wider" href="/heroes">Browse All Heroes<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></section></div><section class="content-lazy relative border-t border-border-subtle py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="hero-faq-heading"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/popol-and-kupa#faq","url":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/popol-and-kupa","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Popol and Kupa build in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Popol and Kupa's strongest build centers on Blade of Despair, Demon Hunter Sword and Great Dragon Spear as core items, paired with the Marksman Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best emblem for Popol and Kupa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The recommended emblem for Popol and Kupa is Marksman Emblem, set up with the Swift, Weapon Master and Quantum Charge talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What lane and role is Popol and Kupa in Mobile Legends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Popol and Kupa is a Marksman hero, usually played as a Jungler and in the Gold Lane. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who counters Popol and Kupa?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Popol and Kupa is countered most by Atlas, Carmilla and Alice, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Popol and Kupa in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Popol and Kupa beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Popol and Kupa hard to play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Popol and Kupa is rated Medium difficulty in Mobile Legends. Popol and Kupa rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Popol and Kupa's win rate this patch?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Popol and Kupa currently holds a 54.7% win rate, a 0.4% pick rate, and a 0.3% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section."}}]}</script><div class="container-mlbb relative z-10"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-gold/10 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h2 id="hero-faq-heading" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-accent-bright md:text-2xl">Popol and Kupa FAQ</h2></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-[80ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-[15px]">Popol and Kupa is a Marksman hero played as a Jungler and in the Gold Lane.<!-- --> Its strongest build centers on Blade of Despair, Demon Hunter Sword, Great Dragon Spear; open the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/build-simulator?hero=popol-and-kupa&amp;items=swift-boots%2Cblade-of-despair%2Cdemon-hunter-sword%2Cgreat-dragon-spear%2Cmalefic-gun%2Cwind-of-nature&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=marksman&amp;talents=swift%2Cweapon-master%2Cquantum-charge&amp;flex=rose-gold-meteor.wind-of-nature%2Csea-halberd.malefic-gun%2Cimmortality.wind-of-nature">Popol and Kupa build simulator</a> for the full item order and final stats, or compare every available loadout on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/builds/popol-and-kupa">Popol and Kupa builds page</a>. <!-- -->See every hero that beats it on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/counter/popol-and-kupa">Popol and Kupa counter page</a>.</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best Popol and Kupa build in 2026?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Popol and Kupa&#x27;s strongest build centers on Blade of Despair, Demon Hunter Sword and Great Dragon Spear as core items, paired with the Marksman Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best emblem for Popol and Kupa?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">The recommended emblem for Popol and Kupa is Marksman Emblem, set up with the Swift, Weapon Master and Quantum Charge talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_valubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What lane and role is Popol and Kupa in Mobile Legends?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_valubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Popol and Kupa is a Marksman hero, usually played as a Jungler and in the Gold Lane. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Who counters Popol and Kupa?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Popol and Kupa is countered most by Atlas, Carmilla and Alice, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Popol and Kupa in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Popol and Kupa beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Is Popol and Kupa hard to play?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Popol and Kupa is rated Medium difficulty in Mobile Legends. Popol and Kupa rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is Popol and Kupa&#x27;s win rate this patch?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Popol and Kupa currently holds a 54.7% win rate, a 0.4% pick rate, and a 0.3% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="content-lazy relative bg-[#000000] border-t border-[#C8AA6E]/20 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 hex-pattern opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(200,170,110,0.03), transparent)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] z-10 overflow-hidden energy-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 pt-4 pb-4"><div class="container-mlbb"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-x-12 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-1 sm:col-span-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81