order-2 lg:sticky lg:self-start\",\"style\":{\"top\":128},\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L7f\",null,{\"target\":\"#hero-article\"}]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"hero-article\",\"className\":\"relative lg:order-1 bg-[#0a0a0a]/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[#C8AA6E]/15 p-5 md:p-9 overflow-hidden\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#F0D060]/55 to-transparent\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-[#F0D060]/40\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Draft Him For The Doorway Fight\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Popol and Kupa is still a niche flex, and that is the correct way to read the hero. This repo's current hero data keeps him in the gold lane and jungle conversation, but not in the blind-pick conversation. He is good when the enemy has to walk through fixed entrances, fight over early objectives on your terms, or send a short-range lane opponent into a brush you already taxed. He is bad when the map stays wide and the enemy can dive Popol directly without caring where Kupa is standing.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The clean games have two traits. First, your own draft gives him a real first layer. That can be a roamer who buys time, an EXP laner who occupies the first choke, or a jungle route that reaches Turtle before the enemy does. Second, the enemy comp has to contest space honestly. If they need to walk into river mouths, jungle hinges, or turret approaches where traps can already be waiting, Popol turns every rotation into a question with a bad answer.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"The bad games look different. Multiple divers, long-range poke that does not care about Kupa's body, or fast skirmish comps that can enter from two angles at once all break the hero's best habit. Popol wants to make one route unsafe. He does not want to answer three routes at the same time. If you cannot point to the exact corridor your traps are meant to own, the draft is already asking too much from him.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Gold lane and jungle both work, but they ask for different wins. Gold lane Popol is about local suffocation: hold one brush, plant one river trap, and make every farm step costly. Jungle Popol is about first move: arrive to Turtle, buff entrances, or invaded camps with information already planted. If your team does not plan to use either pattern, pick a different marksman.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\"],\"$L8e\",\"$L8f\"],\"$L90\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a8:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb9:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6f:[\"$\",\"$L6c\",\"bruno\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/bruno\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6d\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2a733ac5b7d1f97093e82940af6f5008.png\",\"alt\":\"Bruno - The Protector\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgZmlsbD0iIzBkMTIyNSIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex-1 min-w-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h4\",null,{\"className\":\"font-heading font-bold text-text-primary group-hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors truncate\",\"children\":\"Bruno\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-2 mt-0.5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[10px] font-heading uppercase tracki